This code defines a memory pool to manage `NFAPI_CRC_INDICATION_PDU_T` structures, ensuring efficient allocation and thread safety using mutex locks. It includes validation of input parameters, random setting of the CRCFLAG, logging for errors, and batch processing capabilities. The memory pool is initialized with a configurable maximum number of structures, allowing dynamic management while minimizing fragmentation.']

